<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Ahmsa 9-mo net nearly triples.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Ahmsa 9-mo net nearly triples.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		 1995</p>
<p>	*Shr		8.02			  N.A.</p>
<p>	Net Profit	3.114 bln		1.16 bln</p>
<p>	Revs		7.919 bln		6.793 bln</p>
<p>	Gross profit    1.921 bln		1.986 bln</p>
<p>	Oper income     1.362 bln		1.460 bln</p>
<p>	Int fin gain    1.329 bln		    N.A</p>
<p>	  Int paid	1.168 bln		    N.A.</p>
<p>	  Int earned    198.08 million	     N.A.</p>
<p>	  FX gain	 246.67 million	     N.A.</p>
<p>	  Mon gain	2.052 bln		    N.A.</p>
<p>	  NOTE: Shr figure calculated by Reuters. All figures in</p>
<p>Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Altos Hornos de Mexico SA,</p>
<p>Mexico's largest steel maker.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289560</p>
